<title>FINLAND: ALL HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FLAT AT FIX.</title>
<headline>ALL HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FLAT AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>All Helibor rates were</p>
<p>unchanged at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The three-month rate was flat at 3.08 percent.</p>
<p>					 May 13 fix	   May 12 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor			 3.01 pct	     3.01 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor			 3.05 pct	     3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor			 3.08 pct	     3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor			 3.19 pct	     3.19 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor			 3.29 pct	     3.29 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor			3.40 pct	     3.40 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
